WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.250
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.500
Lord Krishna told Arjuna –

3
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.916
Arjuna, listen carefully how you,

4
00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:39.541
by engaging your mind in me, taking my shelter,

5
00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:42.958
and being firm in bhakti yoga,

6
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:47.125
can know me completely
 without any doubt or suspicion.

7
00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.583
Now in this verse,

8
00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:50.625
Lord Krishna explains

9
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:52.916
in what way they will explain to Arjuna,

10
00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:56.250
and how powerful the knowledge is

11
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.625
that they will give to Arjuna.

12
00:01:03.416 --> 00:01:05.791
Lord Krishna tells Arjuna:

13
00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:06.791
Now I will completely

14
00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:11.166
explain to you about this jñāna and vijñāna,

15
00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.875
and after understanding this,

16
00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:17.250
nothing else worth knowing
 will remain in this world.

17
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.541
Here the meaning of jñāna is

18
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:22.750
intellectual understanding of spiritual principles,

19
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.958
which we grasp by reading or listening.

20
00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:28.625
This helps us understand our soul, this world,

21
00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:32.708
and the nature of God.

22
00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:35.208
On the other hand,

23
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:37.791
the meaning of vijñāna is understanding

24
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.958
obtained from experience.

25
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:41.250
The knowledge we read or hear,

26
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.791
when experience of that happens,
it becomes vijñāna.

27
00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:46.250
So when we understand spiritual principles

28
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.791
and practice them,

29
00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:49.833
then we'll experience

30
00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:52.041
going close to God and peace.

31
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:55.166
Now that knowledge has become an experience,

32
00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:57.500
has become vijñāna.

33
00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.625
Understand this with this simple example...

34
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:05.000
We have definitely read and
 heard that honey is sweet

35
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.041
it means this is understanding of jñāna.

36
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:09.208
But sugar is also sweet.

37
00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:11.833
And these two sweetnesses are different,

38
00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:15.000
this will be known to us only upon tasting them.

39
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.500
This is understanding of experience.

40
00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.250
This is vijñāna.

41
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.791
In spiritual life, jñāna and vijñāna

42
00:02:21.791 --> 00:02:23.458
both are important.

43
00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:26.125
We must first gather jñāna.

44
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:27.875
Who is Lord Krishna,

45
00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:29.208
what is the soul,

46
00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:32.333
how this world and spirituality work.

47
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:35.208
But this intellectual knowledge alone

48
00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:36.458
can absolutely not

49
00:02:36.458 --> 00:02:38.125
be completely sufficient.

50
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:39.125
For this very reason,

51
00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.250
Lord Krishna is

52
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.625
also emphasizing vijñāna,

53
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:44.666
which we will receive

54
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:48.833
when we experience these spiritual principles

55
00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:52.666
through practice, sādhanā, and bhakti.

56
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.916
Both jñāna and vijñāna are important.

57
00:02:55.916 --> 00:02:58.625
And this is the reason that many people listen to

58
00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:00.541
and read the Bhagavad Gita,

59
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:02.083
but only they understand

60
00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:05.541
its immense glory who, by practicing it,

61
00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:08.458
experience transformation in life.

62
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:11.291
When we know the soul, Lord Krishna,

63
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:14.416
and the truth of this material world,

64
00:03:14.416 --> 00:03:15.958
then we also understand

65
00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:18.500
the truth of our existence.

66
00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:21.333
And when we have known our existence,

67
00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:22.708
then the need to know

68
00:03:22.708 --> 00:03:27.625
other mysteries of this universe doesn't remain.

69
00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.625
This is the beauty of the Bhagavad Gita –

70
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:33.958
that through this, Krishna will
 give us not only jñāna,

71
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:38.291
but also vijñāna accompanied by experience.

72
00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:49.708
In today's era, there's abundance
 of knowledge and information everywhere.

73
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:53.416
Social media, internet, etc.

74
00:03:53.416 --> 00:03:55.875
On every side,

75
00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:59.791
there are countless sources
 to acquire any knowledge.

76
00:03:59.791 --> 00:04:03.416
Whether that knowledge is about life

77
00:04:03.416 --> 00:04:05.875
or about some other subject.

78
00:04:05.875 --> 00:04:08.458
But countless people

79
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:11.458
remain busy only in seeing

80
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:15.166
and hearing this knowledge.

81
00:04:15.166 --> 00:04:17.708
Neither can they experience it,

82
00:04:17.708 --> 00:04:19.916
nor can they benefit from it.

83
00:04:19.916 --> 00:04:22.916
This is just like

84
00:04:22.916 --> 00:04:25.916
having a complete store of honey in front,

85
00:04:25.916 --> 00:04:30.208
but the person can't experience its sweetness.

86
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.750
Knowledge related to life or any subject

87
00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:36.166
also has value only when,

88
00:04:36.166 --> 00:04:38.000
by practicing it,

89
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.500
it's made into vijñāna in the form of experience.

90
00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:45.166
The first level of experience and vijñāna

91
00:04:45.166 --> 00:04:48.833
is jñāna itself, so its importance will always remain.

92
00:04:48.833 --> 00:04:53.166
But if even after acquiring jñāna,

93
00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:55.791
practice on it wasn't done,

94
00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:58.833
then the hard work will become somewhat useless.

95
00:04:58.833 --> 00:05:05.333
If you want to bring transformation in
 personal, family, or professional life,

96
00:05:05.333 --> 00:05:08.583
then definitely read about their improvement.

97
00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:13.666
But then after that, also act upon those things.

98
00:05:13.666 --> 00:05:16.166
And this is also the right path

99
00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:19.666
for spiritual transformation.

100
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:22.916
The beginning of this path will be with jñāna,

101
00:05:22.916 --> 00:05:26.125
but its benefit will come only

102
00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:29.625
from the vijñāna of practice and experience.

103
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:40.375
I will give Arjuna both jñāna and vijñāna.

104
00:05:40.375 --> 00:05:45.291
Will tell about both theory and experience.

105
00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:46.875
Where theory is incomplete

106
00:05:46.875 --> 00:05:50.750
without experience, there,

107
00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.041
understanding the depth of any experience

108
00:05:53.041 --> 00:05:57.041
without understanding theory is also difficult.

109
00:05:57.041 --> 00:06:00.541
In family settings too, elders always

110
00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:03.000
make this effort

111
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.166
that they give appropriate
 knowledge to younger ones,

112
00:06:06.166 --> 00:06:08.333
teach good life values,

113
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:12.875
give understanding of dealing with problems.

114
00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:15.166
But if all these things

115
00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:18.666
remained only oral knowledge,

116
00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:24.541
then the possibility of life
 transformation from these is less.

117
00:06:24.541 --> 00:06:29.000
Whether knowledge is practical or spiritual,

118
00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:33.666
it's only half part of the journey.

119
00:06:33.666 --> 00:06:39.083
The journey will be complete
 only from experience and practice.

120
00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:41.458
For example,

121
00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:48.458
if children are learning about environmental
 problems in school,

122
00:06:48.458 --> 00:06:53.000
then at home, better than only discussing this,

123
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:57.208
it should be encouraged practically.

124
00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:59.916
Children should be inspired to plant trees,

125
00:06:59.916 --> 00:07:04.625
not to waste water, etc.

126
00:07:04.625 --> 00:07:07.625
Instead of throwing unnecessary items,

127
00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:09.333
their reuse

128
00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:13.125
or donating them should be taught.

129
00:07:13.125 --> 00:07:16.708
Similarly, spiritual principles 
like compassion and kindness

130
00:07:16.708 --> 00:07:18.791
shouldn't be kept limited

131
00:07:18.791 --> 00:07:22.166
only to discussion.

132
00:07:22.166 --> 00:07:24.541
Time should be spent regularly

133
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:29.500
in works like charity and social service.

134
00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.208
Along with discussion of spirituality,

135
00:07:32.208 --> 00:07:37.125
if the whole family also starts praying together,

136
00:07:37.125 --> 00:07:40.791
then think how beneficial this will be.

137
00:07:40.791 --> 00:07:45.291
Examples are many, but the core is one.

138
00:07:45.291 --> 00:07:47.000
Whatever life values

139
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.458
you want to see in your children,

140
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:55.208
only oral knowledge about them isn't enough.

141
00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:58.166
For this, practice and experience

142
00:07:58.166 --> 00:08:01.708
of those values are necessary.

143
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:05.125
And you will have to take initiative for this,

144
00:08:05.125 --> 00:08:08.791
after that the family must be inspired.

145
00:08:08.791 --> 00:08:11.791
Slowly the entire family

146
00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:16.916
will start believing in action more than words.

147
00:08:16.916 --> 00:08:18.875
Think,

148
00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:22.416
what a beautiful transformation this is.

149
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:29.333
The vijñāna of knowledge and experience

150
00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:33.208
that I will share with Arjuna

151
00:08:33.208 --> 00:08:35.166
will be very helpful for Arjuna

152
00:08:35.166 --> 00:08:37.541
not only in this war,

153
00:08:37.541 --> 00:08:42.291
but also going forward.

154
00:08:42.291 --> 00:08:46.166
I will also teach you, through this Bhagavad Gita,

155
00:08:46.166 --> 00:08:50.000
all those aspects of spirituality

156
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.708
that will make your life excellent.

157
00:08:54.708 --> 00:08:58.500
One big principle of spirituality

158
00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.708
is human welfare and service.

159
00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:04.625
And sharing your experience and knowledge

160
00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:07.125
with others

161
00:09:07.125 --> 00:09:10.541
is a work of great service,

162
00:09:10.541 --> 00:09:13.541
which you too should do.

163
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:15.208
In professional settings,

164
00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:19.458
when you share your knowledge with open heart,

165
00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:22.833
then others' personal development also happens

166
00:09:22.833 --> 00:09:27.666
and the organization also
 attains collective success.

167
00:09:27.666 --> 00:09:30.083
As an example,

168
00:09:30.083 --> 00:09:32.250
a senior employee

169
00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.333
who gives training to new colleagues,

170
00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:40.583
then from this not only their 
personal capability improves,

171
00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:42.833
but also in the organization

172
00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:46.875
an atmosphere of mutual cooperation forms.

173
00:09:46.875 --> 00:09:51.458
Experience and knowledge are things to share,

174
00:09:51.458 --> 00:09:53.875
not to hide.

175
00:09:53.875 --> 00:09:57.791
Help others without any selfishness.

176
00:09:57.791 --> 00:10:01.916
This will make them successful, but

177
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:05.375
will also purify your mind.
